; So that a ledger can double as an org-mode document, beancount ignores a
; line opening with one of `*:#!&?%` in column 1. These are the only lines the
; catch-all claims; see errors/junk-line.beancount for what happens to
; anything else.
#!/usr/bin/env bean-check
#+STARTUP: overview
* January
:PROPERTIES:
:CATEGORY: ledger
:END:
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash
** an outline heading, not a transaction flag
? & %
2026-01-02 open Expenses:Groceries
